{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate inclusion of data centre water use in water bills",
        "additional_details": "We feel that water companies are asking more and more of local citizens. With the advent of AI, data centres are popping up everywhere. This request is about ensuring accountability. If a water company is asking me to save water, that\u2019s absolutely fine. But I firmly believe I have a right to know how much  water for locals is going towards data centres.",
        "background": "Mandate water companies to specify what percentage of local water is going towards data centres, so that local communities when asked to conserve water can better understand the context for that request.",
